{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1CH",
  "chapter": 8,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now Benjamin begat Bela his first-born, Ashbel the second, and Aharah the third.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nohah the fourth, and Rapha the fifth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Bela were Addar, and Gera, and Abihud,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abishua, and Naaman, and Ahoah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Gera, and Shephuphan, and Huram.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sons of Ehud: these are the heads of the fathers of the inhabitants of Geba, and they removed them to Manahath:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Naaman, and Ahiah, and Gera, he removed them, and begat Uzza, and Ahihud.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Shaharaim begat ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "children",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the country of Moab, after he had sent them away; Hushim and Baara ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his wives.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he begat of Hodesh his wife, Jobab, and Zibia, and Mesha, and Malcham,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jeuz, and Shachia, and Mirma. These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his sons, heads of the fathers.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And of Hushim he begat Ahitub, and Elpaal.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Elpaal; Eber, and Misham, and Shamed, who built Ono, and Lod, with its town:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Beriah also, and Shema, who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " heads of the fathers of the inhabitants of Ajalon, who drove away the inhabitants of Gath:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Ahio, Shashak, and Jeremoth,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Zebadiah, and Arad, and Ader,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Michael, and Ispah, and Joha, the sons of Beriah;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Zebadiah, and Meshullam, and Hezeki, and Heber,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ishmerai also, and Jezliah, and Jobab, the sons of Elpaal;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jakim, and Zichri, and Zabdi,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Elienai, and Zilthai, and Eliel,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Adaiah, and Beraiah, and Shimrath, the sons of Shimhi;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Ishpan, and Heber, and Eliel,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abdon, and Zichri, and Hanan,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Hananiah, and Elam, and Antothijah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Iphedeiah, and Penuel, the sons of Shashak;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Shamsherai, and Shehariah, and Athaliah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jaresiah, and Eliah, and Zichri, the sons of Jeroham.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " heads of the fathers, by their generations, chief ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ". These dwelt in Jerusalem.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And at Gibeon dwelt the father of Gibeon; whose wife's name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Maachah:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And his first-born son Abdon, and Zur, and Kish, and Baal, and Nadab,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Gedor, and Ahio, and Zacher.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Mikloth begat Shimeah. And these also dwelt with their brethren in Jerusalem, over against them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Ner begat Kish, and Kish begat Saul, and Saul begat Jonathan, and Malchi-shua, and Abinadab, and Esh-baal.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the son of Jonathan ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Merib-baal; and Merib-baal begat Micah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Micah ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", Pithon, and Melech, and Tarea, and Ahaz.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Ahaz begat Jehoadah; and Jehoadah begat Alemeth, and Azmaveth, and Zimri; and Zimri begat Moza,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Moza begat Bineah: Rapha ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his son, Eleasah his son, Azel his son:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Azel had six sons, whose names ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " these, Azrikam, Bocheru, and Ishmael, and Sheariah, and Obadiah, and Hanan. All these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sons of Azel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Eshek his brother ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", Ulam his first-born, Jehush the second, and Eliphelet the third.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.8.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.8.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Ulam were mighty men of valor, archers, and had many sons, and sons' sons a hundred and fifty. All these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the sons of Benjamin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
